{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{fdl-section-modifications}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0fba0364f92bcfa67c4a9502d412215319a9bd697048a299584d8fd5d3a59977", "source_text": "MODIFICATIONS", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c581a8470e7ae2b60407068d08661a49bde61eeb753820c70f67a801db67c8ac", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:title"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n\\begin{itemize}\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e1c595725f32befa50a6ca740cfa0da7bab31fffa70e3dd676cf55a6f6813063", "source_text": "You may copy and distribute a Modified Version of the Document under\nthe conditions of sections 2 and 3 above, provided that you release\nthe Modified Version under precisely this License, with the Modified\nVersion filling the role of the Document, thus licensing distribution\nand modification of the Modified Version to whoever possesses a copy\nof it.  In addition, you must do these things in the Modified Version:", "source_text_hash": "sha256:53ee17d40b505afa418c34333aac5920cb39aa232e1f187458947bc8b7aecea8", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:p001"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[A.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8370f9b8a2446258b161921a0640ae2a769fe9970cd6a02327ce7b66e6e328a3", "source_text": "Use in the Title Page (and on the covers, if any) a title distinct\n   from that of the Document, and from those of previous versions\n   (which should, if there were any, be listed in the History section\n   of the Document).  You may use the same title as a previous version\n   if the original publisher of that version gives permission.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f0a278711b607eb5a1a2ec3554bba9b27c781377d15b4ee13433dcb2aad287ca", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item001"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[B.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e3db1e9921de99e9e15cb2538920f5683ea9ba22b91163a5db65b6e2e97ff6e3", "source_text": "List on the Title Page, as authors, one or more persons or entities\n   responsible for authorship of the modifications in the Modified\n   Version, together with at least five of the principal authors of the\n   Document (all of its principal authors, if it has fewer than five),\n   unless they release you from this requirement.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:21ac18cfcd30efa68efbde16b2bbbed1976ba1ce9c9b674375db24fe85051697", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item002"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[C.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c2773f1683fe74bef339376c430740729fdecd710f286cda05328c3017452ac9", "source_text": "State on the Title page the name of the publisher of the\n   Modified Version, as the publisher.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7f9f50f0584658528133e18c7e7bb28ff6e171894c56ea375915654d73a672bc", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item003"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[D.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fafce7040ea712fa31dd51e3def077ccbb8a9777453dd6774e4f23738792dd28", "source_text": "Preserve all the copyright notices of the Document.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e3fb9237f2c30f9b13ae0be72b8474162817058e610b0387e97a3a8139c122c0", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item004"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[E.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3ad8d37710022ecdd24f79cf824b603184fc636f1a0d4ec6acbf56f8ec4981fe", "source_text": "Add an appropriate copyright notice for your modifications\n   adjacent to the other copyright notices.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6eb4deb93d4fd0a0c46ace8e6ae79ad63094d0c02ed6444f99ccbe2f2f05dad6", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item005"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[F.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3a08a131ee67c2fc6576eb55818aaacf69d41635a54229c50e437ceff489bbfd", "source_text": "Include, immediately after the copyright notices, a license notice\n   giving the public permission to use the Modified Version under the\n   terms of this License, in the form shown in the Addendum below.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:10355c734eeba2c2485becadc04bbd2b2eb2834f7754ba4514e357b38a0a0b9b", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item006"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[G.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4a57d1bfe8568238ec2d5dfc533ace0f51dbfd993d25d1a55f18843c0adf259a", "source_text": "Preserve in that license notice the full lists of Invariant Sections\n   and required Cover Texts given in the Document's license notice.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e3cbeb8b46f0c19dd86c2e49f5f83e65bb5726eca24aea18518ad6487026b0f3", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item007"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[H.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:97863933c595937f2db247c62e56d771434addf769a747b90e8944c6789895f8", "source_text": "Include an unaltered copy of this License.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f701d0de838312bcb29ea2534858a7cb933f59a111b4100181c5aef108616e75", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item008"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[I.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:05ca59cdeb8e223d3cb6e3d6ead6f7f40f175f96bb908d0b02ff311d5b9f36f8", "source_text": "Preserve the section Entitled \"History\", Preserve its Title, and add\n   to it an item stating at least the title, year, new authors, and\n   publisher of the Modified Version as given on the Title Page.  If\n   there is no section Entitled \"History\" in the Document, create one\n   stating the title, year, authors, and publisher of the Document as\n   given on its Title Page, then add an item describing the Modified\n   Version as stated in the previous sentence.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c450d7bfc0394e3c034e81321e3effcf787266356a51774df04dfaf2997b4172", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item009"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[J.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b43620792229e8a8fb9cba97bf0586edbde8aa53e1866311458c153ee751de30", "source_text": "Preserve the network location, if any, given in the Document for\n   public access to a Transparent copy of the Document, and likewise\n   the network locations given in the Document for previous versions\n   it was based on.  These may be placed in the \"History\" section.\n   You may omit a network location for a work that was published at\n   least four years before the Document itself, or if the original\n   publisher of the version it refers to gives permission.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:22a3eb1661be746910ba838fc4dcd6ef1e958d6b084a7428b675b0f5314523aa", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item010"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[K.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7511b3fc52419293d86ca223834cad956e7ae75fe36d49518635cdf7ab24027e", "source_text": "For any section Entitled \"Acknowledgements\" or \"Dedications\",\n   Preserve the Title of the section, and preserve in the section all\n   the substance and tone of each of the contributor acknowledgements\n   and/or dedications given therein.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e5f835db13b1e4a4156e8cfcfb79721b26d64ce27b06890bbbfcafd024ff3e21", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item011"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[L.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5b45f02ab145bec39a3c622ef2e88913e851cf91f98c09419fefb685081a4e82", "source_text": "Preserve all the Invariant Sections of the Document,\n   unaltered in their text and in their titles.  Section numbers\n   or the equivalent are not considered part of the section titles.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e62c938d6dabb58dc0c292dbc53951afe155ac7bacef96a037696c7d584bac87", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item012"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[M.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:68739a9e6c45bdb0e2deaaa3a296257f614f203281967fcfe9c9f00a92a77970", "source_text": "Delete any section Entitled \"Endorsements\".  Such a section\n   may not be included in the Modified Version.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:09c5e1633479825d8cfa8d0960aa05f459d056d02179c4964f0dd9603c989c4b", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item013"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[N.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:746224fdee87e3d476c692cdcada80c6ae3235936aedb63d662dc6e6eb24aa24", "source_text": "Do not retitle any existing section to be Entitled \"Endorsements\"\n   or to conflict in title with any Invariant Section.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6356627f72aa600c01201073d33cfaef4e6b12a108643ce435c2f297eb6028af", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item014"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item[O.]\n   ", "suffix": "\n\\end{itemize}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6cf178adc76586c1fb89276042923c20072141ec4505431c87b8aec7d63e33d1", "source_text": "Preserve any Warranty Disclaimers.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0e8473f6fa4fa22d9b336e3be98109d927c22b39fd924ef89f17a1e9f978eca1", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:item015"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:255b467b045c6f61799b89635a43f094a57798a1617f314559060bca2f56c74d", "source_text": "If the Modified Version includes new front-matter sections or\nappendices that qualify as Secondary Sections and contain no material\ncopied from the Document, you may at your option designate some or all\nof these sections as invariant.  To do this, add their titles to the\nlist of Invariant Sections in the Modified Version's license notice.\nThese titles must be distinct from any other section titles.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ae11e51640a6857623d6b23e20ca846b669c2eff28eb78b7816456026ce8ff56", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:p002"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:255b467b045c6f61799b89635a43f094a57798a1617f314559060bca2f56c74d", "source_text": "You may add a section Entitled \"Endorsements\", provided it contains\nnothing but endorsements of your Modified Version by various\nparties--for example, statements of peer review or that the text has\nbeen approved by an organization as the authoritative definition of a\nstandard.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:106275cda07b90a8d2c81c5223cf59d9ee722b597de5fb03e8cf97b20d4d4c1e", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:p003"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:255b467b045c6f61799b89635a43f094a57798a1617f314559060bca2f56c74d", "source_text": "You may add a passage of up to five words as a Front-Cover Text, and a\npassage of up to 25 words as a Back-Cover Text, to the end of the list\nof Cover Texts in the Modified Version.  Only one passage of\nFront-Cover Text and one of Back-Cover Text may be added by (or\nthrough arrangements made by) any one entity.  If the Document already\nincludes a cover text for the same cover, previously added by you or\nby arrangement made by the same entity you are acting on behalf of,\nyou may not add another; but you may replace the old one, on explicit\npermission from the previous publisher that added the old one.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3bd5e3a6df6a147371255cf089148dbb1a0fd4c6f08199da9bc6912988eee5d5", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:p004"}
{"chapter": "fdl", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05BJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:00862565b67a9547ca0bb204ea82b61ab0ceb6eebdfad79718e084d5a9746921", "source_text": "The author(s) and publisher(s) of the Document do not by this License\ngive permission to use their names for publicity for or to assert or\nimply endorsement of any Modified Version.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4a464d4b1ea6c423639fbf277284a2ce6210bd823c16828e8b5b93624311ad0b", "unit_id": "tag:05BJ:p005"}
